---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Traffic vs. Messaging Audit" description="We audit whether your dental practice has a traffic problem or a messaging problem — and tell you exactly how to fix it.">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">Free Audit</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight mb-6">
          Traffic vs.<br />
          <em class="font-display italic font-normal">Messaging Audit</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          Before we can build a treatment plan to improve your marketing and new patient flow, we need to first figure out what (if anything) is wrong with it.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors">
          Request Your Audit →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE AUDIT -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">What We Look At</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">Two Levers. One Practice. Diagnosed Together.</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-3">Traffic Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">We analyze your Google Ads, organic search visibility, and landing page performance to determine if your practice is actually reaching the right people.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Google Ads campaign structure & spend efficiency</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Keyword targeting and negative keyword gaps</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Geographic targeting accuracy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-teal-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-teal" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-3 3v-3z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-3">Messaging Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">We review your ads, landing pages, and website copy to identify where patient intent is breaking down and trust is being lost before the call.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Ad copy relevance and offer clarity</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Landing page trust signals and call-to-action</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Patient journey alignment from click to call</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">The Process</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">How the Audit Works</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-red text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">You Share Access</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We'll ask for read-only access to your Google Ads account and your website analytics. No changes made without your approval.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-teal text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">We Diagnose</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Dr. Wank personally reviews your traffic and messaging. No junior analysts. No templated reports. A real diagnosis from someone who knows dentistry.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-slate text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">You Get a Verdict</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We deliver a clear, prioritized action plan — whether you work with us or not. You'll know exactly what's broken and what to do next.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-brand-slate py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Ready to Find Out What's Holding You Back?</h2>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">The audit is free. The insight is invaluable.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-md transition-colors">
        Request Your Free Audit →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
